Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.87,0:00:27.85,Line,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(0,0)\fad(260,220)\p1}m 1278 559 l 1161 724 1163 726 1281 560{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.87,0:00:27.85,Line,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(1162,725)\fad(260,220)\p1}m 0 -7 b 4 -7 7 -4 7 0 b 7 4 4 7 0 7 b -4 7 -7 4 -7 0 b -7 -4 -4 -7 0 -7{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.95,0:00:30.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,When I pull the strips outward, new paper comes out from here,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.45,0:00:33.65,Anno,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(1290,600)\fad(220,220)}New crust\N{\fs28\b0\c&HF0E8E0&}forms at the ridge
