Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.15,0:00:33.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,just like new oceanic crust forming at the ridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.75,0:00:37.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,As the rock cools, it records the direction of Earth's magnetic field at that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.45,0:00:37.95,Anno,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(1290,470)\fad(220,220)}Magnetic stripes\N{\fs28\b0\c&HF0E8E0&}record the field's polarity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.57,0:00:37.95,Line,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(0,0)\fad(260,220)\p1}m 1279 468 l 1127 589 1129 591 1280 471{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.57,0:00:37.95,Line,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(1128,590)\fad(260,220)\p1}m 0 -7 b 4 -7 7 -4 7 0 b 7 4 4 7 0 7 b -4 7 -7 4 -7 0 b -7 -4 -4 -7 0 -7{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:42.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,The magnetic patterns on the two strips are perfectly symmetric.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.85,0:00:42.10,Anno,,0,0,0,,{\an6\pos(590,565)\fad(220,220)}Mirror image\N{\fs28\b0\c&HF0E8E0&}same pattern on both sides
